.TH CSTR_COPY 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
cstr_copy \- create an independent copy of a string
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <cstring.h>

cstr_copy(s, err);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Pass-through wrapper for cstring_copy(). Allocates a new cstring with the
same content as s.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
s     cstr to copy
err   Optional pointer to receive an error string on failure
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
New cstr on success, NULL on failure
.fi
.SH NOTES
.nf
Caller must destroy the returned cstring when done
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cstring_copy (3),
.BR cstr_substring (3)
